msgstr "Terjadi kesalahan dan permintaan Anda tidak dapat diproses."

#: app/templates/errors/400.htm:26 app/templates/errors/403.htm:26
#: app/templates/errors/404.htm:26 app/templates/errors/500.htm:26
msgid "Back to Homepage"
msgstr "Kembali ke Beranda"

#: app/templates/errors/403.htm:20
msgid "Access Denied"
msgstr "Akses Ditolak"

#: app/templates/errors/403.htm:22
msgid "You don't have permission to access this resource."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk mengakses sumber daya ini."

#: app/templates/errors/404.htm:20
msgid "Page Not Found!"
msgstr "Halaman Tidak Ditemukan!"

#: app/templates/errors/404.htm:22
msgid ""
"Sorry, but the page you are looking for has not been found on our server."
msgstr "Maaf, halaman yang Anda cari tidak ditemukan di server kami."

#: app/templates/errors/500.htm:20 app/views/main.py:124
msgid "Internal Server Error!"
msgstr "Kesalahan Server Internal!"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:7
#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:10
#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:8
#: app/templates/help/graph-publications-help.htm:7
#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:10
#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:11
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:11
msgid ""
"This page is where you manage all of your <strong>Resource Models</strong> "
"and <strong>Branches</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Halaman ini tempat Anda mengelola semua <strong>Model Sumber Daya</strong> "
"dan <strong>Cabang</strong>."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:12
msgid ""
"If you don't see any listed here, you may want to consider <a "
"href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/projects-and-packages\" "
"target=\"_blank\">loading a package</a>. Alternatively, you can directly "
"import individual Resource Model files through <strong>Add ...</strong> "
"(close this panel to find the button). Finally, to start from scratch just "
"<strong>Add ... > New Resource Model</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Jika tidak ada yang tercantum di sini, pertimbangkan <a href=\"https://"
"arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/projects-and-packages\" "
"target=\"_blank\">memuat paket</a>. Atau impor berkas Model Sumber Daya "
"satu per satu lewat <strong>Tambah ...</strong> (tutup panel ini untuk "
"menemukan tombolnya). Untuk mulai dari nol, <strong>Tambah ... > Model "
"Sumber Daya Baru</strong>."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:13
msgid ""
"Once you have some graphs loaded, there are a few management operations "
"which are only accessible through this page. Use <strong>Manage ...</"
"strong> on a graph to perform the following actions:"
msgstr ""
"Setelah beberapa graf dimuat, ada beberapa operasi pengelolaan yang hanya "
"ada di halaman ini. Gunakan <strong>Kelola ...</strong> pada graf untuk "
"tindakan berikut:"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:16
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:128
msgid "Manage Graph"
msgstr "Kelola Graf"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:17
msgid "Enter the Graph Designer. This is where the magic happens!"
msgstr "Masuk ke Perancang Graf. Di sinilah semuanya terjadi!"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:20
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:153
msgid "Manage Functions"
msgstr "Kelola Fungsi"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:21
#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:25
#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:29
msgid "Resource Models only"
msgstr "Hanya Model Sumber Daya"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:21
msgid ""
"Enter the Function Manager. <strong>You must use the Function Manager to "
"configure the display names of your resources!</strong> Otherwise, all "
"your resources will just be labeled \"Untitled\" in the search results and "
"on the map."
msgstr ""
"Masuk ke Pengelola Fungsi. <strong>Anda harus memakai Pengelola Fungsi "
"untuk mengatur nama tampilan sumber daya!</strong> Jika tidak, semua "
"sumber daya hanya berlabel \"Tanpa Judul\" di hasil pencarian dan di peta."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:24
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:157
msgid "Create Mapping File"
msgstr "Buat Berkas Pemetaan"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:25
msgid ""
"You will need a Mapping File if you plan to <a href=\"https://arches."
"readthedocs.io/en/stable/import-export\" target=\"_blank\">bulk import "
"resources</a> from a CSV file."
msgstr ""
"Anda memerlukan Berkas Pemetaan jika merencanakan <a href=\"https://arches."
"readthedocs.io/en/stable/import-export\" target=\"_blank\">impor sumber "
"daya massal</a> dari berkas CSV."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:28
#: app/templates/views/graph.htm:160
msgid "Delete Instances"
msgstr "Hapus Instans"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:29
msgid ""
"Delete all resource instances that have been made with this Resource "
"Model. <strong>This operation is not reversible!</strong> It's likely this "
"operation would never be used outside of initial installation and testing."
msgstr ""
"Hapus semua instans sumber daya yang dibuat dengan Model Sumber Daya ini. "
"<strong>Operasi ini tidak dapat dibatalkan!</strong> Operasi ini jarang "
"dipakai di luar instalasi dan pengujian awal."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:32
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:856
#: app/templates/views/rdm/modals/export-scheme-form.htm:27
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Ekspor"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:33
msgid ""
"Export this graph to a .json file. It can then be imported into a "
"different Arches installation, or copied into a package."
msgstr ""
"Ekspor graf ini ke berkas .json. Lalu dapat diimpor ke instalasi Arches "
"lain, atau disalin ke paket."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:36
msgid "Clone"
msgstr "Klon"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:37
msgid ""
"Create a duplicate of this graph. Useful during development if you want to "
"alter a Resource Model that already has resource instances saved."
msgstr ""
"Buat duplikat graf ini. Berguna saat pengembangan jika Anda ingin mengubah "
"Model Sumber Daya yang sudah punya instans tersimpan."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:40
#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:19
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:761 app/templates/javascript.htm:940
#: app/templates/views/components/plugins/workflow.htm:34
#: app/templates/views/graph/function-manager.htm:134
#: app/templates/views/rdm/modals/delete-collection-form.htm:44
#: app/templates/views/rdm/modals/delete-scheme-form.htm:44
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Hapus"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:41
msgid ""
"Delete this graph. If this is a Resource Model, all resource instances "
"that have been made with it will also be deleted (as with <strong>Delete "
"Instances</strong> operation above)."
msgstr ""
"Hapus graf ini. Jika ini Model Sumber Daya, semua instans yang dibuat "
"dengannya juga dihapus (seperti operasi <strong>Hapus Instans</strong> di "
"atas)."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:48
msgid "What are Resource Models and Branches?"
msgstr "Apa itu Model Sumber Daya dan Cabang?"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:52
msgid ""
"At the core of an Arches database are a series of structures called "
"\"graphs\", of which there are two types:"
msgstr ""
"Inti basis data Arches adalah serangkaian struktur bernama \"graf\", yang "
"terdiri dari dua tipe:"

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:53
msgid ""
"<strong>Resource Models</strong> -  When creating new Resources, a data "
"entry user must decide which Resource Model to use, determining what "
"information is collected for the Resource. Think of different Resource "
"Models as categories of records in your database&mdash;\"Buildings\" vs. "
"\"Archaeological Sites\" vs. \"Cemeteries\", for example. Every Arches "
"database must have at least one Resource Model."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Model Sumber Daya</strong> - Saat membuat Sumber Daya baru, "
"pengguna entri data harus memilih Model Sumber Daya, yang menentukan "
"informasi yang dikumpulkan. Anggap Model Sumber Daya sebagai kategori "
"rekaman — misalnya \"Bangunan\" vs \"Situs Arkeologi\" vs \"Pemakaman\". "
"Setiap basis data Arches harus memiliki setidaknya satu Model Sumber Daya."

#: app/templates/help/arches-designer-help.htm:54
msgid ""
"<strong>Branches</strong> - You can think of Branches as \"partial\" "
"graphs that can be aggregated to form the \"full\" graph of a Resource "
"Model. They function as resuable building blocks, allowing you to avoid "
"having to manually recreate complex structures in multiple Resource Models."
msgstr ""
"Cabang dapat dianggap sebagai graf \"sebagian\" yang digabung menjadi graf "
"\"penuh\" Model Sumber Daya. Cabang berfungsi sebagai blok bangunan yang "
"dapat dipakai ulang, sehingga struktur kompleks tidak perlu dibuat ulang "
"di banyak Model Sumber Daya."

#: app/templates/help/branch-excel-exporter-help.htm:6
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:834
msgid "Export Branch Excel"
msgstr "Ekspor Excel Cabang"

#: app/templates/help/branch-excel-exporter-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/bulk-data-deletion-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/bulk-edit-concept-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/bulk-manager-case-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/bulk-manager-replace-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/bulk-manager-trim-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/import-branch-excel-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/import-single-csv-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/plugins-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/tile-excel-exporter-help.htm:9
#: app/templates/help/tile-excel-importer-help.htm:9
msgid "Insert plugin help content here."
msgstr "Masukkan isi bantuan plugin di sini."

#: app/templates/help/bulk-data-deletion-help.htm:6
msgid "Bulk Data Deleter"
msgstr "Penghapus Data Massal"

#: app/templates/help/bulk-edit-concept-help.htm:6
msgid "Bulk Concept Editor"
msgstr "Penyunting Konsep Massal"

#: app/templates/help/bulk-manager-case-help.htm:6
msgid "Bulk Data Manager: Change Case"
msgstr "Pengelola Data Massal: Ubah Kapitalisasi"

#: app/templates/help/bulk-manager-replace-help.htm:6
msgid "Bulk Data Manager: Replace"
msgstr "Pengelola Data Massal: Ganti"

#: app/templates/help/bulk-manager-trim-help.htm:6
msgid "Bulk Data Manager: Trim"
msgstr "Pengelola Data Massal: Pangkas"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:6
msgid "Cards Tab"
msgstr "Tab Kartu"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:14
msgid ""
"In this tab you will configure the user-facing aspects of your graph. "
"There are multiple levels to doing so, which are reflected in the levels "
"of the graph tree. <strong>Report Configuration</strong> where you choose "
"the template for the resource report, <strong>Card Configuration</strong> "
"where you'll specify card-related settings, and the <strong>Widget "
"Manager</strong> where you will choose and configure the data entry widget "
"for each node in the graph."
msgstr ""
"Di tab ini Anda mengonfigurasi aspek graf yang dihadapi pengguna. Ada "
"beberapa tingkat, tercermin pada tingkat pohon graf. <strong>Konfigurasi "
"Laporan</strong> untuk memilih templat laporan, <strong>Konfigurasi Kartu</"
"strong> untuk pengaturan kartu, dan <strong>Pengelola Widget</strong> "
"untuk memilih dan mengonfigurasi widget entri data setiap simpul."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:19
#: app/templates/views/graph-designer.htm:438
msgid "Report Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Laporan"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:23
msgid ""
"Each Resource Model must be configured with a report template. Reports "
"show data for all nodes in a resource instance for which the user has Read "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"Setiap Model Sumber Daya harus dikonfigurasi dengan templat laporan. "
"Laporan menampilkan data semua simpul instans yang pengguna punya izin "
"Baca."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:24
msgid "No Header Template"
msgstr "Tidak ada templat tajuk"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:25
msgid "Lists all node data, no special header at the top of the page."
msgstr "Mencantumkan semua data simpul, tanpa tajuk khusus di atas halaman."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:26
msgid "Image Header Template"
msgstr "Templat Tajuk Gambar"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:27
msgid ""
"Use this template for Resource Models that will be be primarily used to "
"record images."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan templat ini untuk Model Sumber Daya yang utamanya merekam gambar."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:30 app/templates/javascript.htm:643
msgid "Included Image Nodes"
msgstr "Simpul Gambar yang Disertakan"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:31
msgid ""
"Choose one or more nodes that hold images in this Resource Model. These "
"images will be presented as a slideshow in the report header."
msgstr ""
"Pilih satu atau lebih simpul yang menyimpan gambar di Model Sumber Daya "
"ini. Gambar itu akan ditampilkan sebagai slideshow di tajuk laporan."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:34
msgid "Map Header Template"
msgstr "Templat Tajuk Peta"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:35
msgid ""
"Use this template for Resource Models that will be be primarily used to "
"record resources that have a geo-location. There are number of settings "
"you should fill out to control the appearance of the map in the header."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan templat ini untuk Model Sumber Daya yang utamanya merekam sumber "
"daya berlokasi geografis. Ada sejumlah pengaturan untuk mengontrol "
"tampilan peta di tajuk."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:38
msgid "Map Controls"
msgstr "Kontrol Peta"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:39
msgid "Choose whether or not the user has access to the Map Tools."
msgstr "Pilih apakah pengguna memiliki akses ke Alat Peta."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:42
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Posisi"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:43
msgid ""
"You can set the position by panning the map. On report load, the map will "
"automatically pan and zoom to the resource geo-location if there is one "
"(also see <strong>Default Value</strong> below). Pitch values are 0-60 "
"(higher = more oblique), <strong>Bearing</strong> values can be positive "
"or negative (270 faces west; -180 faces south). Use <code>ctrl + click</"
"code> then pan the map to change Pitch and Bearing."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengatur posisi dengan menggeser peta. Saat laporan dimuat, "
"peta akan otomatis geser dan zoom ke lokasi geografis sumber daya jika ada "
"(lihat juga <strong>Nilai Default</strong> di bawah). Nilai pitch 0–60 "
"(lebih tinggi = lebih miring), nilai <strong>Bearing</strong> bisa positif "
"atau negatif (270 menghadap barat; -180 menghadap selatan). Gunakan "
"<code>ctrl + klik</code> lalu geser peta untuk mengubah Pitch dan Bearing."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:46
msgid "Zoom"
msgstr "Zoom"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:47
msgid ""
"Zoom levels go from 0 (zoomed out) to 20 (zoomed in). On report load, the "
"map will automatically pan and zoom to the resource geo-location if there "
"is one."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat zoom dari 0 (jauh) hingga 20 (dekat). Saat laporan dimuat, peta "
"akan otomatis geser dan zoom ke lokasi geografis sumber daya jika ada."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:50
msgid "Geocoder"
msgstr "Geocoder"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:51
msgid ""
"Configure which geocoding service the address search bar will use, and "
"whether or not to show the bar at all."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasi layanan geocoding yang dipakai bilah pencarian alamat, dan "
"apakah bilah itu ditampilkan."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:54
msgid "Resource Properties"
msgstr "Properti Sumber Daya"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:55
msgid ""
"Configure some styling options for how the resource appears on the map."
msgstr "Konfigurasi beberapa opsi gaya tampilan sumber daya di peta."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:58
#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:123 app/templates/javascript.htm:245
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:344
#: app/templates/views/components/widgets/non-localized-text.htm:46
msgid "Default Value"
msgstr "Nilai Default"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:59
msgid ""
"Choose whether the map should zoom to the resource geo-location if "
"available or the geo-location of the user."
msgstr ""
"Pilih apakah peta harus zoom ke lokasi geografis sumber daya jika ada, "
"atau ke lokasi geografis pengguna."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:67
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/card-configuration.htm:7
msgid "Card Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi Kartu"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:71
msgid ""
"The settings for Cards are mostly related yo how you want a user to see "
"the card, but some have a more direct bearing on data structure as well. "
"The preview shows what the card will look like to users."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan Kartu terutama terkait bagaimana pengguna melihat kartu, tetapi "
"beberapa juga memengaruhi struktur data. Pratinjau menunjukkan tampilan "
"kartu bagi pengguna."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:74
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/card-configuration.htm:18
msgid "Card Type"
msgstr "Tipe Kartu"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:75
msgid ""
"Choose the Card Component to use. Only the Default Card is available "
"initially, but custom Card Components are a way for developers to enhance "
"the user experience."
msgstr ""
"Pilih Komponen Kartu yang dipakai. Awalnya hanya Kartu Default yang "
"tersedia, tetapi Komponen Kartu kustom memungkinkan pengembang "
"meningkatkan pengalaman pengguna."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:78
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/card-configuration.htm:28
msgid "Card Title"
msgstr "Judul Kartu"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:79
msgid "Users will see this title when performing data entry."
msgstr "Pengguna akan melihat judul ini saat entri data."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:82
#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:43 app/templates/javascript.htm:238
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/card-configuration.htm:37
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:54
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:58
msgid "Subtitle"
msgstr "Subjudul"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:83
msgid "Users will see this subtitle when performing data entry."
msgstr "Pengguna akan melihat subjudul ini saat entri data."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:86
msgid "CSS Classes"
msgstr "Kelas CSS"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:87
msgid ""
"You can add your own CSS classes to this Card to customize its look and "
"feel. Define these classes in your project's \"package.css\" file."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan kelas CSS sendiri ke Kartu ini untuk menyesuaikan tampilan. "
"Tentukan kelas itu di berkas \"package.css\" proyek Anda."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:90
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/card-configuration.htm:75
msgid "Make Card Visible"
msgstr "Tampilkan Kartu"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:91
msgid ""
"Show this Card by default. Developers could hide a card initially, and "
"show it based other variables."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan Kartu ini secara default. Pengembang dapat menyembunyikan kartu "
"di awal, lalu menampilkannya berdasarkan variabel lain."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:94
msgid "Enable Card-level Help"
msgstr "Aktifkan Bantuan Tingkat Kartu"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:95
msgid ""
"To aid data entry users when using this Card, you may want to add some "
"extra guidance. Enable setting to do so, and design the content of this "
"guidance with the Card-Level Help menu."
msgstr ""
"Untuk membantu pengguna entri data pada Kartu ini, Anda dapat menambah "
"panduan ekstra. Aktifkan pengaturan itu, lalu rancang isinya lewat menu "
"Bantuan Tingkat Kartu."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:102
msgid "Widget Management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan Widget"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:106
msgid ""
"Widgets are data entry helpers for each node that collects information; "
"it's often easier to pick a date from a calendar than to type it in, for "
"example. Generally, the data type of the node will determine which Widget "
"template is used. However, in some cases you will have a choice: For "
"example, in the case of a <code>concept</code> node, you can choose a "
"dropdown menu or a set of radio buttons. Similarly, for a <code>string</"
"code> node you can choose a basic text box or a rich text editor."
msgstr ""
"Widget adalah pembantu entri data untuk setiap simpul yang mengumpulkan "
"informasi; sering lebih mudah memilih tanggal dari kalender daripada "
"mengetiknya. Umumnya tipe data simpul menentukan templat Widget. Namun "
"kadang Anda punya pilihan: untuk simpul <code>concept</code>, dropdown "
"atau tombol radio; untuk simpul <code>string</code>, kotak teks dasar atau "
"penyunting teks kaya."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:107
msgid ""
"Depending on the Widget, there are more settings you can configure, most "
"of which are optional and all come with acceptable defaults."
msgstr ""
"Tergantung Widget, ada pengaturan lain yang dapat dikonfigurasi, sebagian "
"besar opsional dan semuanya punya default yang memadai."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:108
msgid "Common Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Umum"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:111
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/widget-configuration.htm:18
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/widget-configuration.htm:21
msgid "Widget Label"
msgstr "Label Widget"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:112
msgid ""
"This will be used in the user interface. The default label comes from the "
"node name."
msgstr ""
"Akan dipakai di antarmuka pengguna. Label default berasal dari nama simpul."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:115
#: app/templates/views/graph-designer.htm:443
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/widget-configuration.htm:27
msgid "Template"
msgstr "Templat"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:116
msgid ""
"The list of available Widgets is determined by the node's data type, "
"though developers can <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
"functions-widgets-datatypes/#widgets\" target=\"_blank\">create new "
"Widgets</a>."
msgstr ""
"Daftar Widget yang tersedia ditentukan oleh tipe data simpul, meskipun "
"pengembang dapat <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
"functions-widgets-datatypes/#widgets\" target=\"_blank\">membuat Widget "
"baru</a>."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:119 app/templates/javascript.htm:200
msgid "Placeholder"
msgstr "Placeholder"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:120
msgid "Shown in the input area before the user has entered anything."
msgstr "Ditampilkan di area input sebelum pengguna memasukkan apa pun."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:124
msgid "If desired, you can define a default value."
msgstr "Jika diinginkan, Anda dapat menentukan nilai default."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:127
msgid "Other Settings by Widget"
msgstr "Pengaturan Lain menurut Widget"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:130
msgid "map-widget"
msgstr "map-widget"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:131
msgid ""
"The map widget allows for a good deal of customization, from the default "
"center and zoom level to default layers."
msgstr ""
"Widget peta memungkinkan banyak kustomisasi, dari pusat dan tingkat zoom "
"default hingga lapisan default."

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:134
msgid "datepicker-widget"
msgstr "datepicker-widget"

#: app/templates/help/cards-tab-help.htm:135
msgid ""
"This widget is used for the normal date data type, not the extended date/"
"time format data type. You can set minumum or maximum dates, change how "
"specific the calendar is when user first opens it, or set the display of "
"the date. However, note that real YYYY-MM-DD dates are stored in the "
"database whether no matter what display format you have chosed for this "
"widget. So if you have set YYYY for the <strong>Date Format</strong> and a "
"user enters \"2005\", then \"2005-01-01\" will be saved in the database."
msgstr ""
"Widget ini dipakai untuk tipe data tanggal biasa, bukan format tanggal/"
"waktu perluasan. Anda dapat mengatur tanggal minimum atau maksimum, "
"mengubah seberapa spesifik kalender saat pertama dibuka, atau mengatur "
"tampilan tanggal. Namun tanggal YYYY-MM-DD nyata disimpan di basis data, "
"apa pun format tampilan. Jadi jika <strong>Format Tanggal</strong> adalah "
"YYYY dan pengguna memasukkan \"2005\", maka \"2005-01-01\" yang disimpan."

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"            <p>Functions are discrete operations that can be associated "
"with a Resource Model and are run on specific nodes or cards whenever a "
"user clicks creates or modify's a Resource. Here in the Function Manager "
"you will associate Functions with this Resource Model and configure them "
"appropriately.</p>\n"
"            <p>To add a Function to this Resource Model, click on it in "
"Function Library, and notice that it is added to the list of Selected "
"Functions. To delete a Function, use the <i class=\"ion-ios-trash add-"
"tooltip\" style=\"color:lightcoral;\"></i> symbol in the upper right "
"corner.\n"
"              "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            <p>Fungsi adalah operasi diskret yang dapat dikaitkan dengan "
"Model Sumber Daya dan dijalankan pada simpul atau kartu tertentu setiap "
"kali pengguna membuat atau mengubah Sumber Daya. Di Pengelola Fungsi Anda "
"mengaitkan Fungsi dengan Model Sumber Daya ini dan mengonfigurasinya.</p>\n"
"            <p>Untuk menambah Fungsi ke Model Sumber Daya ini, klik di "
"Pustaka Fungsi, dan perhatikan bahwa fungsi ditambahkan ke daftar Fungsi "
"Terpilih. Untuk menghapus Fungsi, gunakan simbol <i class=\"ion-ios-trash "
"add-tooltip\" style=\"color:lightcoral;\"></i> di sudut kanan atas.\n"
"              "

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:17
msgid "adding a function - click to view"
msgstr "menambah fungsi - klik untuk melihat"

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:17 app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:34
#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:48 app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:62
#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:76 app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:90
#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:19
#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:32
#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:54
msgid "open in new tab"
msgstr "buka di tab baru"

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:20
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"            <p>Arches comes with three default functions (see below). "
"However, functions are envisioned as the hook through which developers can "
"easily customize Arches capabilities, because new Functions can be added "
"to your individual Arches installation. Learn more <a href=\"https://"
"github.com/archesproject/arches/wiki/Creating-New-Functions%%2C-"
"DataTypes%%2C-and-Widgets\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            <p>Arches menyertakan tiga fungsi default (lihat di bawah). "
"Namun, fungsi dirancang sebagai kait agar pengembang mudah menyesuaikan "
"kemampuan Arches, karena Fungsi baru dapat ditambahkan ke instalasi Anda. "
"Pelajari lebih lanjut <a href=\"https://github.com/archesproject/arches/"
"wiki/Creating-New-Functions%%2C-DataTypes%%2C-and-Widgets\" "
"target=\"_blank\">di sini</a>.</p>\n"
"            "

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:27
msgid "Define Resource Descriptors"
msgstr "Tentukan Deskriptor Sumber Daya"

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:32
msgid ""
"This function will generate one or more descriptors for Resources that are "
"created with this Resource Model. These descriptors are used throughout "
"the database interface, but are not saved as part of the resource. This "
"gives you control over the way Resources are identified and described in "
"search results and elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Fungsi ini menghasilkan satu atau lebih deskriptor untuk Sumber Daya yang "
"dibuat dengan Model Sumber Daya ini. Deskriptor dipakai di seluruh "
"antarmuka, tetapi tidak disimpan sebagai bagian sumber daya. Ini memberi "
"kontrol atas cara Sumber Daya diidentifikasi di hasil pencarian dan tempat "
"lain."

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:33
msgid ""
"Once added to the Resource Model, use the appropriate tab to configure a "
"descriptor template. Choose a card, and variables corresponding to each "
"node in that card will be added to the template, demarcated with "
"<code>&lt; &gt;</code>. You can rearrange these variables and add text to "
"customize the descriptor. When you have set the descriptors, click "
"<strong>Re-Index</strong> to update any existing resources in your "
"database."
msgstr ""
"Setelah ditambahkan ke Model Sumber Daya, gunakan tab yang sesuai untuk "
"mengonfigurasi templat deskriptor. Pilih kartu, dan variabel yang sesuai "
"setiap simpul di kartu itu akan ditambahkan ke templat, ditandai "
"<code>&lt; &gt;</code>. Anda dapat menyusun ulang variabel dan menambah "
"teks. Setelah deskriptor diatur, klik <strong>Indeks ulang</strong> untuk "
"memperbarui sumber daya yang sudah ada."

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:34
msgid ""
"If there are multiple instances of a given card in a Resource, the first "
"one added will be used to create these descriptors. To manually change "
"this, edit the Resource in question and drag the desired tile to the top "
"of the list."
msgstr ""
"Jika ada beberapa instans kartu dalam suatu Sumber Daya, yang pertama "
"ditambahkan dipakai untuk deskriptor. Untuk mengubahnya secara manual, "
"sunting Sumber Daya itu dan seret tile yang diinginkan ke atas daftar."

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:35
msgid ""
"Any user with read access permission to a resource will be seeing these "
"resource descriptors wherever it shows up in search results or on the map. "
"<strong>If a card is intended to be hidden from any group of users, it "
"should not be used in this function.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Setiap pengguna dengan izin baca ke suatu sumber daya akan melihat "
"deskriptor ini di hasil pencarian atau di peta. <strong>Jika kartu "
"dimaksudkan tersembunyi dari suatu kelompok pengguna, jangan dipakai dalam "
"fungsi ini.</strong>"

#: app/templates/help/function-help.htm:37
msgid ""
"\n"
"            <h5>Example</h5>\n"
"            <p>Consider a Resource where the <strong>Name</strong> node "
"value is <em>Folsom School</em> and <strong>Name Type</strong> node value "
"is <em>Primary</em>.</p>\n"
"            <p>Selecting the <strong>Name</strong> card will populate the "
"template with <code>&lt;Name Type&gt;, &lt;Name&gt;</code>. The resulting "
"descriptor would read <em>Primary, Folsom School</em>. Changing the "
"template to <code>Building Name: &lt;Name&gt;</code> would yield "
"<em>Building Name: Folsom School</em>.</p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            <h5>Contoh</h5>\n"
"            <p>Pertimbangkan Sumber Daya dengan nilai simpul <strong>Nama</"
"strong> <em>Folsom School</em> dan nilai simpul <strong>Tipe Nama</strong> "
"<em>Utama</em>.</p>\n"
"            <p>Memilih kartu <strong>Nama</strong> akan mengisi templat "
"dengan <code>&lt;Tipe Nama&gt;, &lt;Nama&gt;</code>. Deskriptor yang "
"dihasilkan akan berbunyi <em>Utama, Folsom School</em>. Mengubah templat "
"menjadi <code>Nama Bangunan: &lt;Nama&gt;</code> akan menghasilkan "
"<em>Nama Bangunan: Folsom School</em>.</p>\n"
"            "

#: app/templates/help/graph-publications-help.htm:11
msgid ""
"\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                The Arches graphs are the visualizations of the data "
"relationships that exist in the Arches system. These relationships are "
"based on a mapping of the CIDOC Conceptual Reference Model (CRM), an "
"ontology focused on cultural heritage (ISO 21127:2006), to the draft "
"International Core Data Standard for Archaeological and Architectural "
"Heritage (CDS).\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Graf Arches adalah visualisasi relasi data dalam sistem "
"Arches. Relasi ini didasarkan pada pemetaan CIDOC Conceptual Reference "
"Model (CRM), ontologi warisan budaya (ISO 21127:2006), ke draf "
"International Core Data Standard for Archaeological and Architectural "
"Heritage (CDS).\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            "

#: app/templates/help/graph-publications-help.htm:16
msgid ""
"\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Whenever a graph is published via the Graph Designer, a "
"historical record of that graph is kept in the database. The historical "
"record consists of a JSON representation of the graph, the user that "
"published the graph, the date and time the graph was published, and any "
"notes the user wrote when publishing the graph. \n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                In the Published Graphs Manager, a permissioned user is "
"able to select which historical record of the graph should be considered "
"active. Changing the active historical record will affect the Graph "
"Designer, Resource Manager, Resource reports, Search, and any custom logic "
"involving the graph.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Setiap kali graf diterbitkan lewat Perancang Graf, catatan "
"riwayat graf itu disimpan di basis data. Catatan terdiri dari representasi "
"JSON graf, pengguna yang menerbitkan, tanggal dan waktu terbit, serta "
"catatan yang ditulis pengguna saat menerbitkan.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                Di Pengelola Graf Terbitan, pengguna berizin dapat memilih "
"catatan riwayat graf mana yang dianggap aktif. Mengubah catatan aktif "
"memengaruhi Perancang Graf, Pengelola Sumber Daya, laporan Sumber Daya, "
"Pencarian, dan logika kustom yang melibatkan graf.\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            "

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:6
msgid "Graph Tab"
msgstr "Tab Graf"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:14
msgid ""
"In this tab you will design the graph&mdash;the core of a Resource Model "
"or Branch. In fact, sometimes Resource Models and Branches are generically "
"referred to as \"graphs\"."
msgstr ""
"Di tab ini Anda merancang graf&mdash;inti Model Sumber Daya atau Cabang. "
"Model Sumber Daya dan Cabang kadang disebut secara umum sebagai \"graf\"."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:15
msgid ""
"For the first step in building a graph, you should fill out the "
"<strong>top-level settings</strong>. Some of these may be changed later "
"while others can't, so make sure to do a lot of testing while developing a "
"graph. With the top-level settings in place, it's time to "
"<strong>construct the graph</strong> by adding nodes (or full Branches) to "
"the graph tree. Along the way, you'll need to set the <strong>node-level "
"settings</strong> for each node you create."
msgstr ""
"Langkah pertama menyusun graf adalah mengisi <strong>pengaturan tingkat "
"atas</strong>. Beberapa dapat diubah kemudian, yang lain tidak, jadi uji "
"banyak saat mengembangkan graf. Setelah pengaturan tingkat atas ada, "
"<strong>susun graf</strong> dengan menambah simpul (atau Cabang penuh) ke "
"pohon graf. Sepanjang jalan, atur <strong>pengaturan tingkat simpul</"
"strong> untuk setiap simpul yang dibuat."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:16
msgid ""
"Once you've finished creating this Resource Model or Branch make sure to "
"set its status to \"active\"."
msgstr ""
"Setelah selesai membuat Model Sumber Daya atau Cabang ini, pastikan "
"statusnya \"aktif\"."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:21
msgid "Draft Graphs"
msgstr "Graf Draf"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:25
msgid ""
"After a graph is published, editing is restricted to safeguard any "
"resources that rely on its current structure. In this state, you cannot "
"add or remove nodes, adjust node settings, or modify the graph tree unless "
"you first create a draft."
msgstr ""
"Setelah graf diterbitkan, penyuntingan dibatasi untuk melindungi sumber "
"daya yang bergantung pada strukturnya. Dalam keadaan ini Anda tidak dapat "
"menambah atau menghapus simpul, mengubah pengaturan simpul, atau "
"memodifikasi pohon graf kecuali membuat draf terlebih dahulu."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:26
msgid ""
"To make changes, choose <strong>Draft a Model Update</strong> from the "
"<strong>Manage…</strong> menu. This creates a separate working copy of the "
"published graph where you can freely edit the graph. While you refine the "
"draft, all existing resources and queries continue to use the published "
"version—so there's no disruption to ongoing processes."
msgstr ""
"Untuk membuat perubahan, pilih <strong>Buat draf pembaruan model</strong> "
"dari menu <strong>Kelola…</strong>. Ini membuat salinan kerja terpisah "
"dari graf terbitan. Saat Anda menyempurnakan draf, semua sumber daya dan "
"kueri yang ada tetap memakai versi terbitan — tanpa mengganggu proses yang "
"berjalan."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:27
msgid ""
"Once you've completed and tested your updates in the draft, publish it to "
"replace the current graph. After the draft becomes the current graph, you "
"may choose to migrate resources that pointed to the previous version so "
"they now reference the latest publication. This will ensure all dependent "
"data and queries stay aligned with the updated graph definition."
msgstr ""
"Setelah pembaruan di draf selesai diuji, terbitkan untuk mengganti graf "
"saat ini. Setelah draf menjadi graf saat ini, Anda dapat memilih "
"memigrasikan sumber daya yang merujuk versi sebelumnya agar merujuk "
"terbitan terbaru. Ini menjaga data dan kueri tetap selaras dengan definisi "
"graf yang diperbarui."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:32
msgid "Top-Level Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Tingkat Atas"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:36
#: app/templates/views/rdm/concept-report.htm:269
#: app/templates/views/rdm/entitytype-report.htm:160
msgid "Identifiers"
msgstr "Pengenal"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:39 app/templates/javascript.htm:370
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:41
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:46
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nama"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:40
msgid ""
"Used to identify this Resource Model throughout the app interface. Default "
"is New Resource Model."
msgstr ""
"Dipakai untuk mengidentifikasi Model Sumber Daya ini di seluruh antarmuka "
"aplikasi. Default-nya Model Sumber Daya Baru."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:44
msgid "Optional subtitle, displayed on the Arches Designer home page."
msgstr "Subjudul opsional, ditampilkan di beranda Perancang Arches."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:47
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:66
msgid "Ontology"
msgstr "Ontologi"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:48
msgid ""
"Decide whether an ontology will be enforced in this graph. To learn more "
"about what this means, read <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/"
"stable/ontologies-in-arches\" target=\"_blank\">Ontologies in Arches</a>. "
"By default, you are allowed to choose between using the CIDOC CRM v6.2, or "
"using no ontology. Once a node or branch has been added to this graph the "
"<strong>Ontology</strong> setting <em>cannot be modified</em>."
msgstr ""
"Putuskan apakah ontologi akan ditegakkan di graf ini. Untuk mempelajari "
"lebih lanjut, baca <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
"ontologies-in-arches\" target=\"_blank\">Ontologi di Arches</a>. Secara "
"default Anda dapat memilih CIDOC CRM v6.2 atau tanpa ontologi. Setelah "
"simpul atau cabang ditambahkan ke graf ini, pengaturan <strong>Ontologi</"
"strong> <em>tidak dapat diubah</em>."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:51
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:78
msgid "Root Class"
msgstr "Kelas Akar"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:52
msgid ""
"This setting is only necessary if an \"Ontology\" has been chosen. Define "
"the ontology class of the root node for this graph."
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan ini hanya perlu jika \"Ontologi\" telah dipilih. Tentukan kelas "
"ontologi simpul akar graf ini."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:55
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:90
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:58
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:59
msgid ""
"Set to \"inactive\" to disallow use of this graph during development. "
"Inactive Resource Models cannot be used to create new resources, and "
"inactive Branches can not be added to a Resource Model."
msgstr ""
"Atur ke \"nonaktif\" untuk melarang pemakaian graf ini selama "
"pengembangan. Model Sumber Daya nonaktif tidak dapat dipakai membuat "
"sumber daya baru, dan Cabang nonaktif tidak dapat ditambahkan ke Model "
"Sumber Daya."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:63
msgid "Resource models that may be related"
msgstr "Model sumber daya yang mungkin terkait"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:64
msgid ""
"Choose which Resource Models can be related to this one with resource-to-"
"resource relationships."
msgstr ""
"Pilih Model Sumber Daya mana yang dapat dihubungkan ke model ini dengan "
"relasi sumber-daya-ke-sumber-daya."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:69
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:99
msgid "Root Node Data Type"
msgstr "Tipe Data Simpul Akar"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:70
msgid "Choose what data type to use for the root node of this Branch."
msgstr "Pilih tipe data untuk simpul akar Cabang ini."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:74 app/templates/javascript.htm:747
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:757
#: app/templates/views/components/etl_modules/base-import.htm:134
#: app/templates/views/components/etl_modules/jsonld-importer.htm:217
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:191
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:140
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Deskripsi"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:77
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:198
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Penulis"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:78
msgid ""
"You can optionally add an <strong>Author</strong> to this graph. Only "
"administrators will see this information."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menambahkan <strong>Penulis</strong> opsional ke graf ini. "
"Hanya administrator yang melihat informasi ini."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:81
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:210
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "Abstrak"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:82
msgid "You can optionally add an <strong>Abstract</strong> to this graph."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menambahkan <strong>Abstrak</strong> opsional ke graf ini."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:82
msgid ""
"Users will see this abstract when they are presented with a choice of what "
"Resource Model to use to create a new resource."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna akan melihat abstrak ini saat memilih Model Sumber Daya untuk "
"membuat sumber daya baru."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:82
msgid ""
"This abstract will be shown in the Branch Library which is used during "
"graph construction."
msgstr ""
"Abstrak ini akan ditampilkan di Pustaka Cabang yang dipakai saat menyusun "
"graf."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:86
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:222
msgid "JSON-LD Context"
msgstr "Konteks JSON-LD"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:87
msgid ""
"Add a <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/json-ld/\">JSON-LD Context</a> for "
"this Resource Model. This allows you to namespace common URI endpoints "
"that are used within a JSON-LD output of the resource. You can enter a "
"plain URL (<code>\"http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/\"</code>), or JSON "
"that defines multiple keys (<code>{\"crm\":\"http://www.cidoc-crm.org/"
"cidoc-crm/\",\"rdf\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"}</"
"code>)."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/json-ld/\">Konteks JSON-LD</a> "
"untuk Model Sumber Daya ini. Ini memungkinkan namespace URI yang sering "
"dipakai dalam keluaran JSON-LD sumber daya. Anda dapat memasukkan URL "
"biasa (<code>\"http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/\"</code>), atau JSON "
"yang menentukan beberapa kunci (<code>{\"crm\":\"http://www.cidoc-crm.org/"
"cidoc-crm/\",\"rdf\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"}</"
"code>)."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:91
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:249
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Tampilan"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:95 app/templates/javascript.htm:710
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/graph-settings.htm:258
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Warna"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:96
msgid ""
"Choose a color for this Resource Model to be used in the related resources "
"force directed graph."
msgstr ""
"Pilih warna Model Sumber Daya ini untuk graf gaya force-directed sumber "
"daya terkait."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:100
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Ikon"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:101
msgid ""
"Choose an icon to identify this graph throughout the app interface. You "
"can browse the icons to select one, or type in the search bar to filter "
"them. Arches uses the <a href=\"http://fontawesome.io/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Font Awesome</a> icon library; custom icons are not "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"Pilih ikon untuk mengidentifikasi graf ini di antarmuka aplikasi. Anda "
"dapat menelusuri ikon atau mengetik di bilah pencarian. Arches memakai "
"pustaka ikon <a href=\"http://fontawesome.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Font "
"Awesome</a>; ikon kustom tidak didukung."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:109
msgid "Construct the Graph"
msgstr "Susun Graf"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:113
msgid ""
"Use the graph tree on the left side of the page to construct the graph. "
"Every new graph starts with a <strong>Top Node</strong>, which will take "
"the name of the new Resource Model or Branch. From this node, you can "
"either <strong>Add Child Node</strong> to add a single node, or "
"<strong>Add Branch</strong> to add an entire existing Branch."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan pohon graf di kiri halaman untuk menyusun graf. Setiap graf baru "
"dimulai dengan <strong>Simpul Puncak</strong>, yang memakai nama Model "
"Sumber Daya atau Cabang baru. Dari simpul ini, Anda dapat <strong>Tambah "
"Simpul Anak</strong> atau <strong>Tambah Cabang</strong> untuk menambah "
"Cabang yang sudah ada."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:114
msgid ""
"At any point during construction you can switch from <strong>Design</"
"strong> mode to <strong>Preview</strong> to see the full shape of your "
"graph."
msgstr ""
"Kapan pun selama penyusunan, Anda dapat beralih dari mode <strong>Rancang</"
"strong> ke <strong>Pratinjau</strong> untuk melihat bentuk penuh graf."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:115
msgid ""
"If you have created a branch structure in a Resource Model that you would "
"like to use in a different Resource Model, you can export it from the "
"graph tree."
msgstr ""
"Jika Anda membuat struktur cabang di suatu Model Sumber Daya dan ingin "
"memakainya di model lain, Anda dapat mengekspornya dari pohon graf."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:120
msgid "Node-Level Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Tingkat Simpul"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:124
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:47
msgid "Node Identifiers"
msgstr "Pengenal Simpul"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:127
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:57
msgid "Node Name"
msgstr "Nama Simpul"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:128
msgid ""
"Set the name for this node. This will be used by default in the user "
"interface, but a different name for display can be configured at the "
"widget level."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan nama simpul ini. Nama ini dipakai secara default di antarmuka, "
"tetapi nama tampilan lain dapat dikonfigurasi di tingkat widget."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:131
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:102
msgid "Ontology Class"
msgstr "Kelas Ontologi"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:132
msgid "only present if this graph uses an ontology"
msgstr "hanya ada jika graf ini memakai ontologi"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:132
msgid ""
"This setting assigns an ontological class to this node. To learn more, "
"read <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/managing-resources/"
"#ontologies-in-arches\" target=\"_blank\">Ontologies in Arches</a>"
msgstr ""
"Pengaturan ini menetapkan kelas ontologis ke simpul ini. Untuk mempelajari "
"lebih lanjut, baca <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
"managing-resources/#ontologies-in-arches\" target=\"_blank\">Ontologi di "
"Arches</a>"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:135
msgid "Relationship to..."
msgstr "Relasi ke..."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:136
msgid ""
"Define what relationship this node has with its parent node (the one "
"directly above it in the graph tree). A verbalization of your choice is "
"shown in the <strong>Semantics</strong> section below this setting."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan relasi simpul ini dengan simpul induknya (yang langsung di "
"atasnya di pohon graf). Verbalisasi pilihan Anda ditampilkan di bagian "
"<strong>Semantik</strong> di bawah pengaturan ini."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:139
msgid "Node Data Type and Settings"
msgstr "Tipe Data dan Pengaturan Simpul"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:140
msgid ""
"Depending on which data type you choose, you may have many more settings "
"to fill out. Those listed below will be present for every node no matter "
"the data type."
msgstr ""
"Tergantung tipe data yang dipilih, mungkin ada banyak pengaturan lain. "
"Yang tercantum di bawah ada pada setiap simpul, apa pun tipe datanya."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:143
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:174
msgid "Data type"
msgstr "Tipe data"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:144
msgid ""
"Choose the data type for this node. Please see the <strong>Default Data "
"Types</strong> section below. Once data is collected for this node, this "
"setting cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Pilih tipe data simpul ini. Lihat bagian <strong>Tipe Data Default</"
"strong> di bawah. Setelah data terkumpul, pengaturan ini tidak dapat "
"diubah."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:147
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:308
msgid "Expose to Advanced Search"
msgstr "Tampilkan di Pencarian Lanjutan"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:148
msgid ""
"If true users will be able to add this node to an Advanced Search query."
msgstr ""
"Jika aktif, pengguna dapat menambahkan simpul ini ke kueri Pencarian "
"Lanjutan."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:151
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:225
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/widget-configuration.htm:75
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Wajib"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:152
msgid ""
"If true a value must be entered for this node in order to save it. Once "
"data is collected for this node, this setting cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Jika diaktifkan, nilai wajib diisi untuk simpul ini agar dapat disimpan. "
"Setelah data terkumpul, pengaturan ini tidak dapat diubah."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:155
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/node-form.htm:246
msgid "Place node(s) in a separate card"
msgstr "Tempatkan simpul di kartu terpisah"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:156
msgid "only present if this node is not already the top node for a card"
msgstr "hanya ada jika simpul ini belum menjadi simpul teratas suatu kartu"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:156
msgid ""
"If true this node will be set in a different card from its parent. This "
"affects data entry, and you are encouraged to test both states of this "
"setting while building you graph. Once data is collected for this node, "
"this setting cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Jika aktif, simpul ini akan berada di kartu berbeda dari induknya. Ini "
"memengaruhi entri data; uji kedua keadaan pengaturan ini saat menyusun "
"graf. Setelah data terkumpul, pengaturan ini tidak dapat diubah."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:159
msgid "Allow Multiple Values"
msgstr "Izinkan Beberapa Nilai"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:160
msgid ""
"While certain node data types allow the storage of multiple values in a "
"single node, \"concept-list\" for example, this setting is how you control "
"cardinality at a higher level. When determining whether or not to use this "
"setting, we recommend testing out the resource editor interface directly."
msgstr ""
"Meskipun beberapa tipe data simpul memungkinkan beberapa nilai dalam satu "
"simpul, misalnya \"concept-list\", pengaturan ini mengontrol kardinalitas "
"di tingkat lebih tinggi. Saat memutuskan memakainya, kami sarankan menguji "
"antarmuka penyunting sumber daya secara langsung."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:167
msgid "Default Data Types"
msgstr "Tipe Data Default"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:171
msgid ""
"The data type of a node determines what kind of data that node will store. "
"Once chosen, some data types will require further configuration."
msgstr ""
"Tipe data simpul menentukan jenis data yang disimpan simpul itu. Setelah "
"dipilih, beberapa tipe data memerlukan konfigurasi lebih lanjut."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:172
msgid ""
"Developers can <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/functions-"
"widgets-datatypes/#datatypes\" target=\"_blank\">create new datatypes</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pengembang dapat <a href=\"https://arches.readthedocs.io/en/stable/"
"functions-widgets-datatypes/#datatypes\" target=\"_blank\">membuat tipe "
"data baru</a>."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:175
msgid "boolean"
msgstr "boolean"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:176
msgid "Use this to store a \"yes\"/\"no\" or \"true\"/\"false\" value."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan ini untuk menyimpan nilai \"ya\"/\"tidak\" atau \"benar\"/"
"\"salah\"."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:179
msgid "concept"
msgstr "concept"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:180
msgid ""
"Stores one of a series of concepts from the Reference Data Manager. Users "
"will choose a concept in a dropdown list or set of radio buttons. You'll "
"further be prompted to choose a <strong>Concept Collection</strong>&mdash;"
"this controls which concepts the user is able to choose from."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan salah satu dari serangkaian konsep dari Pengelola Data Rujukan. "
"Pengguna memilih konsep di daftar dropdown atau tombol radio. Anda juga "
"akan diminta memilih <strong>Koleksi Konsep</strong>&mdash;ini mengontrol "
"konsep mana yang dapat dipilih."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:183
msgid "concept-list"
msgstr "concept-list"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:184
msgid "Stores multiple concepts in a single node."
msgstr "Menyimpan beberapa konsep dalam satu simpul."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:187
msgid "date"
msgstr "tanggal"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:188
msgid "Stores a CE calendar date. See etdf for BCE and fuzzy date handling."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan tanggal kalender Masehi. Lihat EDTF untuk SM dan tanggal fuzzy."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:191
msgid "edtf"
msgstr "edtf"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:192
msgid ""
"Stores an <a href='https://www.loc.gov/standards/datetime/' "
"target='_blank'>Extended Date/Time Format</a> value. Use this data type "
"for BCE dates or dates with uncertainty. This datatype requires extra "
"configuration to inform the database search methods how to interpret EDTF "
"values. Data entry users can enter edtf dates using formats listed in the "
"<a href='https://www.loc.gov/standards/datetime/pre-submission.html' "
"target='_blank'>EDTF draft specification</a>."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan nilai <a href='https://www.loc.gov/standards/datetime/' "
"target='_blank'>Extended Date/Time Format</a>. Gunakan tipe data ini untuk "
"tanggal SM atau tanggal dengan ketidakpastian. Tipe data ini memerlukan "
"konfigurasi ekstra agar metode pencarian basis data menafsirkan nilai "
"EDTF. Pengguna entri data dapat memasukkan tanggal EDTF dengan format di "
"<a href='https://www.loc.gov/standards/datetime/pre-submission.html' "
"target='_blank'>spesifikasi draf EDTF</a>."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:195
msgid "file-list"
msgstr "file-list"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:196
msgid "Stores one or mores files. Use this to upload images, documents, etc."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan satu atau lebih berkas. Gunakan ini untuk mengunggah gambar, "
"dokumen, dll."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:199
msgid "iiif-drawing"
msgstr "iiif-drawing"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:200
msgid ""
"Used to store an <a href='http://iiif.io/' target='_blank'>IIIF compliant</"
"a> image."
msgstr ""
"Dipakai untuk menyimpan gambar <a href='http://iiif.io/' "
"target='_blank'>patuh IIIF</a>."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:203
msgid "geojson-feature-collection"
msgstr "geojson-feature-collection"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:204
msgid ""
"Stores geographic coordinates, and is used to show a resource on the map."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan koordinat geografis, dan dipakai untuk menampilkan sumber daya "
"di peta."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:207
msgid "domain-value"
msgstr "domain-value"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:208
msgid ""
"Similar to \"concept\", choose this to present the user with a dropdown "
"list or set of radio buttons. Unlike \"concept\" this dropdown menu will "
"not come from your system-wide controlled vocubulary, but from a list of "
"values that you must define here."
msgstr ""
"Mirip dengan \"concept\", pilih ini untuk menampilkan daftar dropdown atau "
"tombol radio. Berbeda dari \"concept\", menu ini tidak berasal dari "
"kosakata terkendali sistem, melainkan dari daftar nilai yang harus Anda "
"tentukan di sini."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:211
msgid "domain-value-list"
msgstr "domain-value-list"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:212
msgid "Stores multiple domain-values in a single node."
msgstr "Menyimpan beberapa nilai domain dalam satu simpul."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:215
msgid "csv-chart-json"
msgstr "csv-chart-json"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:216
msgid "Stores a csv chart formatted as JSON."
msgstr "Menyimpan bagan CSV berformat JSON."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:219
msgid "node-value"
msgstr "node-value"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:220
msgid ""
"Stores a reference to a different node in this graph. This would allow you "
"to store duplicate data in more than one branch."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan rujukan ke simpul lain dalam graf ini. Ini memungkinkan data "
"duplikat di lebih dari satu cabang."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:223
msgid "number"
msgstr "number"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:224
msgid "Stores a number."
msgstr "Menyimpan angka."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:227
msgid "resource-instance"
msgstr "resource-instance"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:228
msgid ""
"Embeds a separate resource instance into this node. For example, you could "
"add a node called \"Assessed By\" to a condition assessment branch, and "
"use this data type. This would allow you to associate an individual stored "
"in your database as an Actor resource with a specific condition "
"assessment. Note that this construction is different from making a "
"\"resource-to-resource relationship\". "
msgstr ""
"Menanam instans sumber daya terpisah ke simpul ini. Misalnya, tambahkan "
"simpul \"Dinilai Oleh\" ke cabang penilaian kondisi, dan pakai tipe data "
"ini. Ini memungkinkan mengaitkan individu yang tersimpan sebagai sumber "
"daya Aktor dengan penilaian kondisi tertentu. Konstruksi ini berbeda dari "
"membuat \"relasi sumber-daya-ke-sumber-daya\". "

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:231
msgid "resource-instance-list"
msgstr "resource-instance-list"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:232
msgid "Stores a list of resource instances in a single node."
msgstr "Menyimpan daftar instans sumber daya dalam satu simpul."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:235
msgid "semantic"
msgstr "semantik"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:236
msgid ""
"<em>A semantic node does not store data.</em> Semantic nodes are used "
"where necessary to make symbolic connections between other nodes, "
"generally in order to follow ontological rules. The top node of every "
"graph is a semantic node."
msgstr ""
"<em>Simpul semantik tidak menyimpan data.</em> Simpul semantik dipakai "
"untuk koneksi simbolis antar simpul, umumnya mengikuti aturan ontologi. "
"Simpul teratas setiap graf adalah simpul semantik."

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:239
msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

#: app/templates/help/graph-tab-help.htm:240
msgid ""
"Stores a string of text. This could be something simple like a name, or "
"more something elaborate like a descriptive paragraph with formatting and "
"hyperlinks."
msgstr ""
"Menyimpan string teks. Bisa sederhana seperti nama, atau lebih panjang "
"seperti paragraf deskriptif dengan format dan hyperlink."

#: app/templates/help/import-branch-excel-help.htm:6
msgid "Import Branch Excel"
msgstr "Impor Excel Cabang"

#: app/templates/help/import-single-csv-help.htm:6
msgid "Import Single CSV"
msgstr "Impor CSV Tunggal"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>Three categories of Map Layers will appear on your map: "
"<strong>Resource Layers</strong> (the contents of your database), "
"<strong>Basemaps</strong> (static background layers), and "
"<strong>Overlays</strong> (custom data layers from outside your database). "
"To configure a layer, first select its category in the top bar, and then "
"choose it from the list at left.</p>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        <p>Tiga kategori Lapisan Peta akan muncul di peta: <strong>Lapisan "
"Sumber Daya</strong> (isi basis data), <strong>Peta Dasar</strong> "
"(lapisan latar statis), dan <strong>Overlay</strong> (lapisan data kustom "
"dari luar basis data). Untuk mengonfigurasi lapisan, pilih kategorinya di "
"bilah atas, lalu pilih dari daftar di kiri.</p>\n"
"      "

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:13
msgid ""
"Resource Layers display the resource layers in your database. One Resource "
"Layer is created for each node with a geospatial datatype (for example, "
"<code>geojson-feature-collection</code>). You are able to customize the "
"appearance and visibility of each Resource Layer in the following ways."
msgstr ""
"Lapisan Sumber Daya menampilkan lapisan sumber daya di basis data. Satu "
"Lapisan Sumber Daya dibuat untuk setiap simpul bertipe data geografis "
"(misalnya <code>geojson-feature-collection</code>). Anda dapat "
"menyesuaikan tampilan dan visibilitas tiap lapisan dengan cara berikut."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:14
#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:34
#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:49
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:699
#: app/templates/views/map-layer-manager.htm:172
msgid "Service Styling"
msgstr "Gaya Layanan"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:15
msgid ""
"Define the way features will look on the map. The example map has "
"demonstration features that give you a preview of the changes you make. "
"You can choose to use <strong>Advanced Editing</strong> to create a more "
"nuanced style. Note that changes made in Advanced Editing will not be "
"reflected if you switch back to basic editing. For styling reference, "
"checkout the <a href='https://www.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/style-spec/' "
"target='_blank'>MapBox Style Specification</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan tampilan fitur di peta. Peta contoh memiliki fitur demonstrasi "
"sebagai pratinjau perubahan. Anda dapat memakai <strong>Penyuntingan "
"Lanjutan</strong> untuk gaya yang lebih bernuansa. Perubahan di "
"Penyuntingan Lanjutan tidak akan tercermin jika Anda kembali ke "
"penyuntingan dasar. Referensi gaya: <a href='https://www.mapbox.com/mapbox-"
"gl-js/style-spec/' target='_blank'>Spesifikasi Gaya MapBox</a>."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:16
#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:36
#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:51
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:460
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/card-configuration.htm:70
#: app/templates/views/map-layer-manager.htm:168
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:17
msgid ""
"You can change the name of this overlay if desired; by default it will use "
"the name of its Resource Model. You make also set the layer to be added to "
"the search map by default, or choose a custom icon for it."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat mengubah nama overlay ini; secara default memakai nama Model "
"Sumber Dayanya. Anda juga dapat menambahkan lapisan ke peta pencarian "
"secara default, atau memilih ikon kustom."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:18
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:701
msgid "Clustering"
msgstr "Klaster"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:19
msgid ""
"Arches uses 'clustering' to better display resources at low zoom levels "
"(zoomed out). You are able to control the clustering settings for each "
"layer individually."
msgstr ""
"Arches memakai 'klaster' agar sumber daya lebih jelas pada zoom rendah "
"(dijauhkan). Anda dapat mengatur klaster per lapisan."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:21
msgid ""
"<strong>Cluster Distance</strong> - distance (in pixels) within which "
"resources will be clustered"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Jarak klaster</strong> - jarak (dalam piksel) di mana sumber daya "
"akan diklasterkan"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:22
msgid ""
"<strong>Cluster Max Zoom</strong> - zoom level after which clustering will "
"<em>stop</em> being used"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zoom maksimum klaster</strong> - tingkat zoom setelah klaster "
"<em>berhenti</em> dipakai"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:23
msgid ""
"<strong>Cluster Min Points</strong> - minimum number of points needed to "
"create a cluster"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Titik minimum klaster</strong> - jumlah titik minimum untuk "
"membuat klaster"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:25
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:208 app/templates/javascript.htm:700
#: app/templates/views/graph-designer.htm:333
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/permission-settings-form.htm:10
#: app/templates/views/graph/graph-designer/permission-settings-form.htm:57
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "Izin"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:26
msgid ""
"This tab shows the permissions for the nodegroup whose geometry is "
"displayed in this Resource Layer. Permissions are defined in the Graph "
"Designer."
msgstr ""
"Tab ini menampilkan izin kelompok simpul yang geometrinya ditampilkan di "
"Lapisan Sumber Daya ini. Izin ditentukan di Perancang Graf."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:33
msgid ""
"A Basemap will always be present in your map. Arches comes with a few "
"default basemaps, but advanced users are able to add more. Once added, "
"there are few ways to configure each basemap."
msgstr ""
"Peta dasar selalu ada di peta Anda. Arches menyertakan beberapa peta dasar "
"default, tetapi pengguna mahir dapat menambah lagi. Setelah ditambah, ada "
"beberapa cara mengonfigurasi tiap peta dasar."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:35
msgid ""
"Define a style for this basemap. Note that depending on the type of layer, "
"there are different styling options. For styling reference, checkout the "
"<a href='https://www.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/style-spec/#layers' "
"target='_blank'>MapBox Style Specification</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan gaya peta dasar ini. Tergantung tipe lapisan, opsi gaya berbeda. "
"Referensi gaya: <a href='https://www.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/style-spec/"
"#layers' target='_blank'>Spesifikasi Gaya MapBox</a>."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:38
msgid "<strong>Layer name</strong> - enter a name to identify this basemap"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Nama lapisan</strong> - masukkan nama untuk mengidentifikasi peta "
"dasar ini"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:39
msgid ""
"<strong>Default search map</strong> - choose this layer to be the default "
"basemap"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Peta pencarian default</strong> - pilih lapisan ini sebagai peta "
"dasar default"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:40
#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:55
msgid "<strong>Layer icon</strong> - associate an icon with this layer"
msgstr "<strong>Ikon lapisan</strong> - kaitkan ikon dengan lapisan ini"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:48
msgid ""
"Overlays allow you to incorporate map layers from external sources. Note "
"that Search Results and Search Markets are treated as overlays, and can be "
"customize separately. New overlays can be added with a little behind-the-"
"scenes work. Once added, there are few ways to configure each overlay."
msgstr ""
"Overlay memungkinkan lapisan peta dari sumber eksternal. Hasil Pencarian "
"dan Penanda Pencarian diperlakukan sebagai overlay, dan dapat "
"dikustomisasi terpisah. Overlay baru dapat ditambahkan dengan sedikit "
"pekerjaan di belakang layar. Setelah ditambah, ada beberapa cara "
"mengonfigurasi tiap overlay."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:50
msgid ""
"Define a style for this overlay. Note that depending on the type of layer, "
"there are different styling options. For styling reference, checkout the "
"<a href='https://www.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/style-spec/#layers' "
"target='_blank'>MapBox Style Specification</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tentukan gaya overlay ini. Tergantung tipe lapisan, opsi gaya berbeda. "
"Referensi gaya: <a href='https://www.mapbox.com/mapbox-gl-js/style-spec/"
"#layers' target='_blank'>Spesifikasi Gaya MapBox</a>."

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:53
msgid "<strong>Layer name</strong> - enter a name to identify this overlay"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Nama lapisan</strong> - masukkan nama untuk mengidentifikasi "
"overlay ini"

#: app/templates/help/map-manager-help.htm:54
msgid ""
"<strong>Default search map</strong> - choose whether this overlay should "
"be shown in the search map by default. Note that in the search map itself "
"you can change the order of the layers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Peta pencarian default</strong> - pilih apakah overlay ini "
"ditampilkan di peta pencarian secara default. Di peta pencarian sendiri "
"Anda dapat mengubah urutan lapisan."

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:7
msgid "Permissions Tab"
msgstr "Tab Izin"

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:15
msgid ""
"Arches allows you to define user and user group permissions on a per-"
"nodegroup basis. For example, you may want to hide the coordinates of a "
"Resource from the public, or allow a certain group of users to only update "
"the condition assessment section of a Resource Model. Rules like these are "
"all enforced using permissions."
msgstr ""
"Arches memungkinkan izin pengguna dan kelompok per kelompok simpul. "
"Misalnya, Anda mungkin ingin menyembunyikan koordinat dari publik, atau "
"hanya mengizinkan kelompok tertentu memperbarui bagian penilaian kondisi. "
"Aturan seperti itu ditegakkan dengan izin."

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:16
msgid "Permissions Levels"
msgstr "Tingkat Izin"

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:20
msgid ""
"Allows users to delete instances of this nodegroup. Note, this is not the "
"same as being allowed to delete an entire resource, permissions for which "
"are not handled here."
msgstr ""
"Mengizinkan pengguna menghapus instans kelompok simpul ini. Ini bukan sama "
"dengan izin menghapus seluruh sumber daya, yang tidak diatur di sini."

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:23
msgid "No Access"
msgstr "Tidak Ada Akses"

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:24
msgid ""
"Disallows users from seeing or editing instances of this nodegroup. Use "
"this permission level to hide sensitive data from non-authenticated users "
"(the public)."
msgstr ""
"Melarang pengguna melihat atau menyunting instans kelompok simpul ini. "
"Gunakan tingkat izin ini untuk menyembunyikan data sensitif dari pengguna "
"yang tidak terautentikasi (publik)."

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:27
msgid "Read"
msgstr "Baca"

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:28
msgid ""
"Allows users to see this nodegroup's card. If disallowed, the card/"
"nodegroup will be hidden from the map and resource reports."
msgstr ""
"Mengizinkan pengguna melihat kartu kelompok simpul ini. Jika ditolak, "
"kartu/kelompok simpul disembunyikan dari peta dan laporan sumber daya."

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:31
msgid "Create/Update"
msgstr "Buat/Perbarui"

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:32
msgid ""
"Allows users to create or edit instances of this nodegroup. This provides "
"the ability to let users edit some information about a resource, while be "
"restricted from editing other information."
msgstr ""
"Mengizinkan pengguna membuat atau menyunting instans kelompok simpul ini. "
"Ini memungkinkan menyunting sebagian informasi sumber daya, sambil "
"dibatasi pada informasi lain."

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:35
msgid "Non-Authenticated Users"
msgstr "Pengguna Tidak Terautentikasi"

#: app/templates/help/permissions-tab-help.htm:36
msgid ""
"You may notice that by default Arches comes with a \"Guest\" group, as "
"well as user named \"anonymous\" who is a member of that group. "
"<strong>Any non-authenticated user is treated as the \"anonymous\" user.</"
"strong> This means that all permissions applied to the Guest group will be "
"given to anyone who views the website without logging in."
msgstr ""
"Secara default Arches menyertakan kelompok \"Guest\" serta pengguna "
"\"anonymous\" yang menjadi anggotanya. <strong>Setiap pengguna yang tidak "
"terautentikasi diperlakukan sebagai pengguna \"anonymous\".</strong> "
"Artinya, semua izin kelompok Guest diberikan kepada siapa pun yang melihat "
"situs tanpa masuk."

#: app/templates/help/plugins-help.htm:6
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Plugin"

#: app/templates/help/profile-manager-help.htm:7
msgid ""
"The profile manager allows you to update your account information, such as "
"your password, at any time."
msgstr ""
"Pengelola profil memungkinkan Anda memperbarui informasi akun, misalnya "
"kata sandi, kapan saja."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:7
msgid ""
"The Reference Data Management (RDM) enables the creation and maintenance "
"of controlled vocabularies that are used throughout your database. In "
"Arches, controlled vocabularies consist of Concepts, and these Concepts "
"are managed in Thesauri and Collections. In the RDM you can create new "
"Thesauri, create new Concepts, import Concepts from external an endpoint "
"(like the Getty AAT), and -- the ultimate goal -- create Collections, "
"which will be used in your database as data input dropdown lists."
msgstr ""
"Pengelolaan Data Rujukan (RDM) memungkinkan pembuatan dan pemeliharaan "
"kosakata terkendali di seluruh basis data. Di Arches, kosakata terkendali "
"terdiri dari Konsep, yang dikelola dalam Tesaurus dan Koleksi. Di RDM Anda "
"dapat membuat Tesaurus baru, Konsep baru, mengimpor Konsep dari endpoint "
"eksternal (seperti Getty AAT), dan — tujuan utamanya — membuat Koleksi "
"yang dipakai sebagai daftar dropdown entri data."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:9 app/templates/javascript.htm:683
#: app/templates/views/rdm/concept-report.htm:356 settings.py:117
msgid "Concepts"
msgstr "Konsep"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:11
msgid ""
"A Concept is a qualitative property that can be attached to a resource, "
"something like \"Stone\" (which may describe a building material) or "
"\"House\" (which may describe a past use for a structure). The advantage "
"of storing these properties as Concepts is that a Concept may have "
"attributes of its own. In the case of \"House\", we could add an alternate "
"label, \"Dwelling\" to that Concept. Then, if a user searches for "
"\"dwelling\", any resource with the \"House\" Concept attached to it will "
"be found."
msgstr ""
"Konsep adalah sifat kualitatif yang dapat dilekatkan ke sumber daya, "
"misalnya \"Batu\" (bahan bangunan) atau \"Rumah\" (guna masa lalu suatu "
"struktur). Keuntungan menyimpan sifat ini sebagai Konsep adalah Konsep "
"dapat memiliki atribut sendiri. Untuk \"Rumah\", Anda dapat menambah label "
"alternatif \"Dwelling\". Kemudian, jika pengguna mencari \"dwelling\", "
"sumber daya dengan Konsep \"Rumah\" akan ditemukan."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:12
msgid ""
"Concepts can also be nested, to allow more complex and meaningful "
"relationships between them. For example, \"House\" may appear next to "
"\"School\" within a parent Concept called \"Building Use\"."
msgstr ""
"Konsep juga dapat bersarang, untuk relasi yang lebih kompleks dan "
"bermakna. Misalnya, \"House\" dapat muncul di samping \"School\" dalam "
"Konsep induk bernama \"Building Use\"."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:16 app/templates/rdm.htm:58
msgid "Thesauri"
msgstr "Tesaurus"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:18
msgid ""
"A Thesaurus is an entire set of Concepts which can be imported and "
"exported as a whole. You can create as many new Thesauri as you need, or "
"just add new Concepts to the default \"Arches\" Thesaurus. The "
"organization of your Thesauri has no impact on the way Concepts will be "
"exposed to the public or used throughout the app."
msgstr ""
"Tesaurus adalah kumpulan Konsep yang dapat diimpor dan diekspor utuh. Anda "
"dapat membuat Tesaurus baru sebanyak yang diperlukan, atau menambah Konsep "
"ke Tesaurus default \"Arches\". Organisasi Tesaurus tidak memengaruhi cara "
"Konsep ditampilkan ke publik atau dipakai di aplikasi."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:22 app/templates/rdm.htm:61
#: app/templates/views/rdm/concept-report.htm:344
msgid "Collections"
msgstr "Koleksi"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:24
msgid ""
"Collections, or Concept Collections as they are sometimes called, are "
"custom aggregations of Concepts that will be used in your app as dropdown "
"lists during the data entry process. Collections allow you to reorganize "
"your Concepts for the specific purpose of data entry, so your dropdown "
"lists do not have to look anything like your Thesaurus. You can create as "
"many Collections as you want, or add new Concepts to existing Collections."
msgstr ""
"Koleksi, atau Koleksi Konsep, adalah agregasi kustom Konsep yang dipakai "
"sebagai daftar dropdown saat entri data. Koleksi memungkinkan Anda menata "
"ulang Konsep untuk entri data, sehingga daftar dropdown tidak harus "
"menyerupai Tesaurus. Anda dapat membuat Koleksi sebanyak yang diinginkan, "
"atau menambah Konsep ke Koleksi yang ada."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:28
msgid "Example - Create a New Thesaurus"
msgstr "Contoh - Buat Tesaurus Baru"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:30
msgid ""
"In the video below, a new Thesaurus is created. Once you have made a "
"Thesaurus, you can begin creating a hierarchy of Concepts within it. "
"Remember, the final step will be to make a new Collection and add Concepts "
"to it (from <em>any</em> of your Thesauri)."
msgstr ""
"Dalam video di bawah, Tesaurus baru dibuat. Setelah Tesaurus ada, Anda "
"dapat membuat hierarki Konsep di dalamnya. Langkah terakhir adalah membuat "
"Koleksi baru dan menambahkan Konsep ke dalamnya (dari <em>tesaurus mana "
"pun</em>)."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:32 app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:46
#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:60 app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:74
#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:88
msgid "click to view demonstration"
msgstr "klik untuk melihat demonstrasi"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:42
msgid "Example - Create a Top Concept"
msgstr "Contoh - Buat Konsep Puncak"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:44
msgid ""
"The first level of organization within a Thesaurus is a set of Top "
"Concepts. A Top Concept may be something like \"Architectural Styles\" and "
"its children Concepts will be the actual styles themselves. Below, a new, "
"empty Top Concept is added to an empty Thesaurus."
msgstr ""
"Tingkat organisasi pertama dalam Tesaurus adalah Konsep Puncak. Konsep "
"Puncak dapat berupa \"Gaya Arsitektur\" dan anaknya adalah gaya itu "
"sendiri. Di bawah, Konsep Puncak baru yang kosong ditambahkan ke Tesaurus "
"kosong."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:56
msgid "Example - Create New Concepts"
msgstr "Contoh - Buat Konsep Baru"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:58
msgid ""
"To create a new Concept, begin by selecting the Top Concept under which it "
"should be placed. This will bring the details about the Top Concept into "
"the main panel. Use the Manage dropdown to \"Add Child\", type in a label, "
"and select the correct language for the label."
msgstr ""
"Untuk membuat Konsep baru, mulai dengan memilih Konsep Puncak tempat "
"konsep itu diletakkan. Detail Konsep Puncak akan tampil di panel utama. "
"Gunakan dropdown Kelola untuk \"Tambah Anak\", ketik label, dan pilih "
"bahasa yang benar."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:70
msgid "Example - Add an Alternate Label to a Concept"
msgstr "Contoh - Tambah Label Alternatif ke Konsep"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:72
msgid ""
"To improve the searchability of your Concepts, you can add as many "
"alternate labels to each one as you want Below, the label \"Dwelling\" is "
"added to the Concept \"House\". The result is that anyone using "
"\"Dwelling\" as a search term will be shown Resources that have the "
"\"House\" Concept."
msgstr ""
"Untuk meningkatkan kemampuan pencarian Konsep, Anda dapat menambah label "
"alternatif. Di bawah, label \"Dwelling\" ditambahkan ke Konsep \"House\". "
"Hasilnya, siapa pun yang mencari \"Dwelling\" akan melihat Sumber Daya "
"yang memiliki Konsep \"House\"."

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:84
msgid "Example - Create a Collection"
msgstr "Contoh - Buat Koleksi"

#: app/templates/help/rdm-help.htm:86
msgid ""
"Creating a Collection is very similar to creating a Thesaurus. However, "
"you will be adding existing Concepts to a Collection (potentially from "
"more than one Thesaurus) instead of creating new ones. Below, a new "
"Collection is created. To go further, select the Collection, and use the "
"\"Add dropdown entry\" link to add existing Concepts to this Collection. "
"When configuring the Graph for a Branch or Resource Model, you will now be "
"able to add this Concept Collection to a node."
msgstr ""
"Membuat Koleksi sangat mirip dengan membuat Tesaurus. Namun, Anda menambah "
"Konsep yang sudah ada ke Koleksi (mungkin dari lebih dari satu Tesaurus) "
"alih-alih membuat yang baru. Di bawah, Koleksi baru dibuat. Selanjutnya, "
"pilih Koleksi, dan gunakan tautan \"Tambah entri dropdown\" untuk menambah "
"Konsep yang ada. Saat mengonfigurasi Graf Cabang atau Model Sumber Daya, "
"Anda dapat menambahkan Koleksi Konsep ini ke simpul."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:8
msgid "Creating Resource Data"
msgstr "Membuat Data Sumber Daya"

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:12
msgid ""
"The Resource Editor is used to create new or edit existing Resources. What "
"you see on the left-hand side of the page is this Resource's \"card "
"tree\", which shows all of the data entry cards that you can edit. Think "
"of \"creating data\" as \"adding cards\"."
msgstr ""
"Penyunting Sumber Daya dipakai untuk membuat atau menyunting Sumber Daya. "
"Di sisi kiri halaman ada \"pohon kartu\" Sumber Daya ini, yang menampilkan "
"semua kartu entri data. Anggap \"membuat data\" sebagai \"menambah kartu\"."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:13
msgid ""
"To begin, select a card, enter data, and click <strong>Add</strong>. Some "
"cards may allow multiple instances, in which case you will be able to add "
"as many of the same type as you want."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mulai, pilih kartu, masukkan data, lalu klik <strong>Tambah</"
"strong>. Beberapa kartu mengizinkan beberapa instans, sehingga Anda dapat "
"menambah sebanyak yang diinginkan."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:14
msgid ""
"Note that in the demonstration below, the \"Define Resource Descriptors\" "
"function has already been configured to set the Name card value as the "
"resource display name."
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahwa dalam demonstrasi di bawah, fungsi \"Tentukan Deskriptor "
"Sumber Daya\" sudah dikonfigurasi agar nilai kartu Nama menjadi nama "
"tampilan sumber daya."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:17
msgid "basic card data enty - click to view"
msgstr "entri data kartu dasar - klik untuk melihat"

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:25
msgid ""
"Once you have saved data for a resource, you can see a full summary by "
"selecting the top card. This is the resource report."
msgstr ""
"Setelah data sumber daya disimpan, ringkasan lengkap dapat dilihat dengan "
"memilih kartu teratas. Itulah laporan sumber daya."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:26
msgid ""
"In some cases, cards will be nested within other cards, as in the example "
"of adding a geo-location below."
msgstr ""
"Dalam beberapa kasus, kartu bersarang di dalam kartu lain, seperti contoh "
"menambahkan lokasi geografis di bawah."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:30
msgid "nested card data enty - click to view"
msgstr "entri data kartu bersarang - klik untuk melihat"

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:43
msgid "Creating Resources Relations"
msgstr "Membuat Relasi Sumber Daya"

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:48
msgid ""
"In the Resource Editor you can also access the <strong>Related Resources "
"Editor</strong> . To create a relationship between this resource and "
"another in your database, open the editor, find the resource, and click "
"<strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Di Penyunting Sumber Daya Anda juga dapat membuka <strong>Penyunting "
"Sumber Daya Terkait</strong>. Untuk membuat relasi antara sumber daya ini "
"dan yang lain, buka penyunting, temukan sumber daya, lalu klik "
"<strong>Tambah</strong>."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:49
msgid ""
"Your Resource Model will need to be configured to allow relations with the "
"target Resource Model. If relations are not allowed, resources in the "
"dropdown menu will not be selectable."
msgstr ""
"Model Sumber Daya Anda perlu dikonfigurasi agar relasi dengan Model Sumber "
"Daya target diizinkan. Jika relasi tidak diizinkan, sumber daya di menu "
"dropdown tidak dapat dipilih."

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-help.htm:52
msgid "create resource relation - click to view"
msgstr "buat relasi sumber daya - klik untuk melihat"

#: app/templates/help/resource-editor-landing-help.htm:7
msgid ""
"Choose a Resource Model to begin creating a new Resource in your database."
msgstr ""
"Pilih Model Sumber Daya untuk mulai membuat Sumber Daya baru di basis data "
"Anda."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:7
msgid "Introduction to Search"
msgstr "Pengantar Pencarian"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:9 app/templates/help/search-help.htm:31
#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:43
#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:56
#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:75
#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:101
msgid "expand image in new tab"
msgstr "bentangkan gambar di tab baru"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:12
msgid ""
"<strong>Search Bar</strong> The quickest way to search the database is to "
"begin typing in the search bar. You'll be presented with database "
"terminology which you can use to create one or more simple filters. The "
"search bar also acts as an aggregator of <em>all</em> currently enabled "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bilah Pencarian</strong> Cara tercepat mencari adalah mengetik di "
"bilah pencarian. Anda akan melihat istilah basis data untuk membuat satu "
"atau lebih filter sederhana. Bilah pencarian juga menggabungkan <em>semua</"
"em> filter yang sedang aktif."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:13
msgid ""
"<strong>Search Tools</strong> There are a number tools you can use to "
"explore the database, which are described in detail below."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Alat pencarian</strong> Ada sejumlah alat untuk menjelajahi basis "
"data, yang dijelaskan secara rinci di bawah."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:14
msgid ""
"<strong>Search Results</strong> Whenever you change any search filters, "
"the updated search results will be listed here. You can link to a "
"resource's report, zoom to it on the map, or view its related resources."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Hasil Pencarian</strong> Setiap kali filter pencarian diubah, "
"hasil terbaru tercantum di sini. Anda dapat menaut ke laporan sumber daya, "
"zoom di peta, atau melihat sumber daya terkait."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:15
msgid ""
"<strong>Search Panel</strong> The contents of this panel will change "
"depending on what search tool you are using. Typically, the map will be "
"activated by default."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Panel pencarian</strong> Isi panel ini berubah tergantung alat "
"pencarian yang dipakai. Biasanya peta aktif secara default."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:20 app/templates/index.htm:197
msgid "Search Tools"
msgstr "Alat Pencarian"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:23 app/templates/javascript.htm:465
msgid "Map"
msgstr "Peta"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:25
msgid ""
"Search results can be represented on the map in two ways: <strong>markers</"
"strong> show the first set of resources in the search results, and "
"<strong>cells</strong> are used to give a general spatial representation "
"of <em>all</em> resources in the search results."
msgstr ""
"Hasil pencarian dapat ditampilkan di peta dengan dua cara: "
"<strong>penanda</strong> menampilkan kumpulan pertama hasil, dan "
"<strong>sel</strong> memberi gambaran spasial umum dari <em>semua</em> "
"sumber daya dalam hasil pencarian."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:26
msgid ""
"In addition to displaying search results, the map can show resource layers "
"(showing all resources), or custom overlays, if any have been added. You "
"control the visibility of all layers and basemaps with the tool panel on "
"the right."
msgstr ""
"Selain menampilkan hasil pencarian, peta dapat menampilkan lapisan sumber "
"daya (semua sumber daya) atau overlay kustom jika ada. Anda mengontrol "
"visibilitas lapisan dan peta dasar dengan panel alat di kanan."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:27
msgid ""
"Finally, you can add a spatial filter to your query by using the map "
"drawing tools to draw a shape and apply a buffer distance if desired."
msgstr ""
"Terakhir, Anda dapat menambahkan filter spasial ke kueri dengan alat "
"gambar peta untuk menggambar bentuk dan menerapkan jarak buffer jika "
"diinginkan."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:29
msgid "How to change basemap"
msgstr "Cara mengganti peta dasar"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:36
msgid ""
"To change the basemap, open the <strong>Basemaps</strong> tab, then click "
"on the basemap you would like to use."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengganti peta dasar, buka tab <strong>Peta Dasar</strong>, lalu "
"klik peta dasar yang ingin dipakai."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:41
msgid "How to toggle search results layer"
msgstr "Cara mengalihkan lapisan hasil pencarian"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:48
msgid ""
"To activate or deactivate overlays, open the <strong>Overlays</strong> "
"tab, then use the switch to show or hide the layer on the map."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkan overlay, buka tab <strong>Overlay</"
"strong>, lalu gunakan sakelar untuk menampilkan atau menyembunyikan "
"lapisan di peta."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:54
msgid "How to search with spatial query"
msgstr "Cara mencari dengan kueri spasial"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:61
msgid ""
"To search with a spatial query, open the <strong>Filter</strong> tab, then "
"use the <strong>Select A Filter</strong> section to draw a new geometry on "
"the map. Additionally, you can search within a distance of your spatial "
"filter by adjusting the <strong>Buffer</strong> distance."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mencari dengan kueri spasial, buka tab <strong>Filter</strong>, lalu "
"gunakan <strong>Pilih Filter</strong> untuk menggambar geometri baru di "
"peta. Anda juga dapat mencari dalam jarak tertentu dengan menyesuaikan "
"jarak <strong>Buffer</strong>."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:68
msgid "Time"
msgstr "Waktu"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:70
msgid ""
"You can apply a temporal criterion to your query by using the Time Filter. "
"You have the option of creating the filter by hand, or you can use the "
"time wheel. The time wheel is a graphic representation of all the "
"resources in the database, organized chronologically."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menerapkan kriteria temporal dengan Filter Waktu. Anda dapat "
"membuat filter secara manual, atau memakai roda waktu. Roda waktu adalah "
"representasi grafis semua sumber daya di basis data, disusun kronologis."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:73
msgid "How to apply time filter with time wheel"
msgstr "Cara menerapkan filter waktu dengan roda waktu"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:80
msgid ""
"To filter resources using the Time Wheel, open the <strong>Date Filter</"
"strong> tab, then click on the segment that corresponds with the desired "
"filter on the time wheel."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memfilter sumber daya dengan Roda Waktu, buka tab <strong>Filter "
"Tanggal</strong>, lalu klik segmen yang sesuai pada roda waktu."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:87
#: app/templates/views/graph/card-configuration/card-form-preview.htm:93
#: app/templates/views/graph/card-configuration/card-form-preview.htm:135
msgid "Saved"
msgstr "Tersimpan"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:89
msgid ""
"Saved searches allow you to view pre-made queries. Saved searches are "
"created by database administrators, so the number of saved searches shown "
"here will vary from one database to the next."
msgstr ""
"Pencarian tersimpan memungkinkan Anda melihat kueri yang sudah dibuat. "
"Pencarian tersimpan dibuat administrator basis data, jadi jumlahnya "
"berbeda-beda antar basis data."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:93 app/templates/javascript.htm:705
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Lanjutan"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:95
msgid ""
"You can use the advanced search to make more complex queries based on data "
"attributes, or \"facets\". While the basic search filter allows you to "
"combine multiple filters, advanced search is the only way to combine "
"filters with an <strong>or</strong> operator, and also gives you access to "
"more comparison operators."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat memakai pencarian lanjutan untuk kueri yang lebih kompleks "
"berdasarkan atribut data, atau \"faset\". Filter dasar memungkinkan "
"menggabungkan beberapa filter, tetapi pencarian lanjutan adalah satu-"
"satunya cara menggabungkan filter dengan operator <strong>atau</strong>, "
"dan memberi lebih banyak operator perbandingan."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:96
msgid ""
"In the example below, a search is made within a single resource type for "
"any name <strong>like</strong> \"church\" <strong>or</strong> any name "
"<strong>like</strong> \"gate\"."
msgstr ""
"Dalam contoh di bawah, pencarian dilakukan dalam satu tipe sumber daya "
"untuk nama apa pun <strong>seperti</strong> \"church\" <strong>atau</"
"strong> nama apa pun <strong>seperti</strong> \"gate\"."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:99
msgid "How to search for multiple words in names"
msgstr "Cara mencari beberapa kata dalam nama"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:106
msgid ""
"To use the Advanced Search, open the <strong>Advanced</strong> tab, then "
"under the <strong>Search Facets</strong> panel, select the properties of "
"Resource Types that you'd like to filter by by clicking on them. This will "
"add them to the Advanced Search Panel. You can then structure your "
"advanced search by adjusting the search facets in the Advanced Search "
"Panel."
msgstr ""
"Untuk memakai Pencarian Lanjutan, buka tab <strong>Lanjutan</strong>, lalu "
"di panel <strong>Faset Pencarian</strong> pilih properti Tipe Sumber Daya "
"yang ingin difilter dengan mengkliknya. Properti itu akan ditambahkan ke "
"Panel Pencarian Lanjutan. Kemudian susun pencarian dengan menyesuaikan "
"faset di panel itu."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:113
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:115
msgid ""
"For each resource listed in the search results you can view its related "
"resources with the \"Related Resources\" link under the description. By "
"viewing Related Resources, you get a new view of the database: not how "
"resources are related geographically nor chronologically, but "
"qualitatively."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap sumber daya di hasil pencarian, Anda dapat melihat sumber "
"daya terkait lewat tautan \"Sumber Daya Terkait\" di bawah deskripsi. "
"Tampilan ini menunjukkan relasi kualitatif, bukan geografis atau "
"kronologis."

#: app/templates/help/search-help.htm:116
msgid ""
"There two methods for viewing Related Resources: in a table where each "
"related resource is a row, or in a graph where resources are shown as "
"nodes in a graph, with relationships connecting them."
msgstr ""
"Ada dua cara melihat Sumber Daya Terkait: dalam tabel (setiap sumber daya "
"terkait satu baris), atau dalam graf (sumber daya sebagai simpul, relasi "
"sebagai penghubung)."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"        <p>A number of global settings can be defined or altered here.</"
"p>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        <p>Sejumlah pengaturan global dapat ditentukan atau diubah di sini."
"</p>\n"
"      "

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:13
msgid "Default Application Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Aplikasi Default"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:15
msgid ""
"\n"
"                <strong>Application Name</strong> - Name of your Arches "
"app, to be displayed in the browser title bar and elsewhere.<br>\n"
"                <strong>Default Data Import/Export User</strong> - Name to "
"associate with data that is imported into the system.<br>\n"
"              "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                <strong>Nama Aplikasi</strong> - Nama aplikasi Arches "
"Anda, ditampilkan di bilah judul peramban dan tempat lain.<br>\n"
"                <strong>Pengguna Impor/Ekspor Data Default</strong> - Nama "
"yang dikaitkan dengan data yang diimpor ke sistem.<br>\n"
"              "

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:20
msgid "Web Analytics"
msgstr "Analitik Web"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:22
msgid ""
"\n"
"                <strong>Google Analytics Key</strong> - If you have made a "
"Google Analytics Key to track your app's traffic, enter it here.<br>\n"
"              "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                <strong>Kunci Google Analytics</strong> - Jika Anda punya "
"kunci Google Analytics untuk melacak lalu lintas aplikasi, masukkan di "
"sini.<br>\n"
"              "

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:26
msgid "Thesaurus Service Providers"
msgstr "Penyedia Layanan Tesaurus"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:28
msgid ""
"\n"
"                <strong>Thesaurus SPARQL Endpoint</strong> - Advanced "
"users may create more SPARQL endpoints and register them here. These "
"endpoints will be available in the RDM and allow you to import thesaurus "
"entries from external sources.<br>\n"
"              "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                <strong>Endpoint SPARQL Tesaurus</strong> - Pengguna mahir "
"dapat membuat lebih banyak endpoint SPARQL dan mendaftarkannya di sini. "
"Endpoint itu akan tersedia di RDM dan memungkinkan impor entri tesaurus "
"dari sumber eksternal.<br>\n"
"              "

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:35
msgid "Map Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Peta"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:37
msgid "Mapbox API"
msgstr "API Mapbox"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:38
msgid ""
"Arches uses the Mapbox mapping library for map display and data creation. "
"Arches also supports Mapbox basemaps and other services."
msgstr ""
"Arches memakai pustaka peta Mapbox untuk tampilan peta dan pembuatan data. "
"Arches juga mendukung peta dasar Mapbox dan layanan lain."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:40
msgid ""
"<strong>Mapbox API Key (Optional)</strong> - By default, Arches uses some "
"basemap web services from Mapbox. You will need to <a href='https://www."
"mapbox.com/help/create-api-access-token/' target=\"_blank\">create a free "
"API key</a> (or \"access token\") for these services to be activated. "
"Alternatively, you could remove all of the default basemaps and add your "
"own, non-Mapbox layers."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Kunci API Mapbox (opsional)</strong> - Secara default Arches "
"memakai beberapa layanan peta dasar Mapbox. Anda perlu <a href='https://"
"www.mapbox.com/help/create-api-access-token/' target=\"_blank\">membuat "
"kunci API gratis</a> (atau \"token akses\") agar layanan itu aktif. Atau "
"hapus semua peta dasar default dan tambahkan lapisan non-Mapbox sendiri."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:41
msgid ""
"<strong>Mapbox Sprites</strong> - Path to Mapbox sprites (use default)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Sprite Mapbox</strong> - Jalur ke sprite Mapbox (gunakan default)."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:42
msgid "<strong>Mapbox Glyphs</strong> - Path to Mapbox glyphs (use default)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Glif Mapbox</strong> - Jalur ke glif Mapbox (gunakan default)."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:44
msgid "Project Extent"
msgstr "Cakupan Proyek"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:45
msgid ""
"Draw a polygon representing your project's extent. These bounds will serve "
"as the default for the search result grid bounds, and map bounds in "
"search, cards, and reports."
msgstr ""
"Gambar poligon yang mewakili cakupan proyek Anda. Batas ini menjadi "
"default batas kisi hasil pencarian, serta batas peta di pencarian, kartu, "
"dan laporan."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:46
msgid "Map Zoom"
msgstr "Zoom Peta"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:47
msgid ""
"You can define the zoom behavior of your map. Zoom level 0 shows the whole "
"world (and is the absolute minimum zoom level) and zoom level 20 is the "
"maximum level that most map services support."
msgstr ""
"Anda dapat menentukan perilaku zoom peta. Tingkat zoom 0 menampilkan "
"seluruh dunia (minimum mutlak) dan tingkat 20 adalah maksimum yang "
"didukung kebanyakan layanan peta."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:49
msgid ""
"<strong>Default Zoom</strong> - Set the zoom level that the map will be "
"shown at by default."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zoom default</strong> - Atur tingkat zoom peta saat pertama "
"ditampilkan."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:50
msgid ""
"<strong>Min Zoom</strong> - Minimum zoom level defines how far the user "
"can zoom out when viewing the map."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zoom minimum</strong> - Tingkat zoom minimum menentukan seberapa "
"jauh pengguna dapat memperkecil peta."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:51
msgid ""
"<strong>Max Zoom</strong> - Maximum zoom level defines how far the user "
"can zoom in when viewing the map."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Zoom maksimum</strong> - Tingkat zoom maksimum menentukan seberapa "
"jauh pengguna dapat memperbesar peta."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:53
msgid "Search Results Grid"
msgstr "Kisi Hasil Pencarian"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:54
msgid ""
"Arches aggregates search results and displays them as hexagons. You will "
"need to set default parameters for the hexagon size and precision."
msgstr ""
"Arches menggabungkan hasil pencarian dan menampilkannya sebagai heksagon. "
"Anda perlu mengatur parameter default ukuran dan ketelitian heksagon."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:56
msgid ""
"<strong>Hexagon Size (in km)</strong> - Set the actual size of the hex "
"bins that will be shown on the map."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ukuran heksagon (km)</strong> - Atur ukuran sebenarnya kotak "
"heksagon yang ditampilkan di peta."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:57
msgid ""
"<strong>Hexagon Grid Precision</strong> - Set the precision with which the "
"contents of the hex bins will be calculated."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ketelitian kisi heksagon</strong> - Atur ketelitian penghitungan "
"isi kotak heksagon."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:59
msgid ""
"<strong>Warning:</strong> A large project area combined with a small "
"hexagon size and/or high precision will take a very long time to load, and "
"can crash your browser. We suggest changing these settings in small "
"increments to find the best combination for your project."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Peringatan:</strong> Area proyek besar plus ukuran heksagon kecil "
"dan/atau ketelitian tinggi akan memakan waktu sangat lama untuk dimuat, "
"dan dapat membuat peramban macet. Ubah pengaturan ini secara bertahap "
"untuk kombinasi terbaik."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:63
msgid "Basic Search Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Pencarian Dasar"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:65
msgid "Set the default search results behavior."
msgstr "Atur perilaku default hasil pencarian."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:66
msgid ""
"\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <strong>Number of search results per page</strong> - Set "
"the number of search results shown per page. Note this also defines the "
"number of search result markers that are shown on the map.<br>\n"
"                <strong>Number of search hints per dropdown</strong> - Set "
"the number of search hints that will appear under the search bar as you "
"type in search terms.<br>\n"
"                <strong>Max number of search results to export</strong> - "
"Set the maximum number of resources to be exported from the search "
"results. This value should generally be evenly divible by the "
"SEARCH_RESULT_LIMIT setting in Arches (10,000 by default).\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            <p>\n"
"                <strong>Jumlah hasil pencarian per halaman</strong> - Atur "
"jumlah hasil pencarian yang ditampilkan per halaman. Ini juga menentukan "
"jumlah penanda hasil pencarian di peta.<br>\n"
"                <strong>Jumlah petunjuk pencarian per dropdown</strong> - "
"Atur jumlah petunjuk yang muncul di bawah bilah pencarian saat Anda "
"mengetik.<br>\n"
"                <strong>Jumlah maksimum hasil pencarian untuk diekspor</"
"strong> - Atur jumlah maksimum sumber daya yang diekspor dari hasil "
"pencarian. Nilai ini umumnya harus habis dibagi pengaturan "
"SEARCH_RESULT_LIMIT di Arches (10.000 secara default).\n"
"            </p>\n"
"            "

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:76
msgid "Temporal Search Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Pencarian Temporal"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:78
msgid ""
"Arches creates a Time Wheel based on the resources in your database, to "
"allow for quick temporal visualization and queries. A few aspects of this "
"temporal search are defined here."
msgstr ""
"Arches membuat Roda Waktu berdasarkan sumber daya di basis data, untuk "
"visualisasi dan kueri temporal yang cepat. Beberapa aspek pencarian "
"temporal ditentukan di sini."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:80
msgid ""
"<strong>Color Ramp</strong> - <em>not currently implemented</em> The color "
"ramp for the time wheel. For further reference, check out the <a "
"href='https://github.com/d3/d3-3.x-api-reference/blob/master/Ordinal-"
"Scales.md' target=\"_blank\">d3 API reference</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Ramp warna</strong> - <em>belum diimplementasikan</em> Ramp warna "
"untuk roda waktu. Referensi lebih lanjut: <a href='https://github.com/d3/"
"d3-3.x-api-reference/blob/master/Ordinal-Scales.md' "
"target=\"_blank\">referensi API d3</a>."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:81
msgid ""
"<strong>Time wheel configuration</strong> - <em>not currently implemented</"
"em>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Konfigurasi roda waktu</strong> - <em>belum diimplementasikan</em>"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:86
#: app/templates/javascript.htm:442
msgid "Saved Searches"
msgstr "Pencarian Tersimpan"

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:88
msgid ""
"Arches allows you save a search and present it as convenience for your "
"users. Saved Searches appear as search options in the main Search page. "
"Creating a Saved Search is a three-step process."
msgstr ""
"Arches memungkinkan Anda menyimpan pencarian dan menyajikannya sebagai "
"kemudahan bagi pengguna. Pencarian Tersimpan muncul sebagai opsi di "
"halaman Pencarian utama. Membuatnya terdiri dari tiga langkah."

#: app/templates/help/system-settings-help.htm:90
msgid ""
"\n"
"                <strong>1. Specify Search Criteria</strong> - Go to the "
"Search page and enter all the criteria you would like to use to configure "
"your Saved Search. You may notice that with the addition of each new "
"search filter (either by using the term filter, map filtering tools, or "
"temporal filters) the URL for the page will change.<br>\n"
"                <strong>2. Copy the URL</strong> - In your browser address "
"bar, copy the <em>entire</em> URL. This will be a long string that defines "
"each of the search filters created in step 1.<br>\n"
"                <strong>3. Create the Saved Search</strong> - Finally, "
"head back to this page and fill out the settings that you see at left. You "
"can also upload an image that will be shown along with your Search "
"Search.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                <strong>1. Tentukan Kriteria Pencarian</strong> - Buka "
"halaman Pencarian dan masukkan semua kriteria yang ingin dipakai untuk "
"Pencarian Tersimpan. Anda mungkin memperhatikan bahwa setiap penambahan "
"filter (filter istilah, alat peta, atau filter temporal) mengubah URL "
"halaman.<br>\n"
"                <strong>2. Salin URL</strong> - Di bilah alamat peramban, "
"salin <em>seluruh</em> URL. Ini string panjang yang mendefinisikan setiap "
"filter pencarian dari langkah 1.<br>\n"
"                <strong>3. Buat Pencarian Tersimpan</strong> - Kembali ke "
"halaman ini dan isi pengaturan di kiri. Anda juga dapat mengunggah gambar "
"yang akan ditampilkan bersama Pencarian Tersimpan.\n"
"            "

