msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Design custom information "
"management applications in hours. Build your\n"
"                                        databases with Arches Designer, "
"then configure your interface all without having to\n"
"                                        write any code.\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                        Rancang aplikasi pengelolaan "
"informasi kustom dalam hitungan jam. Bangun basis data\n"
"                                        dengan Perancang Arches, lalu "
