"                                    "

#: app/templates/index.htm:289
msgid "Interface Manager"
msgstr "Pengelola Antarmuka"

#: app/templates/index.htm:291
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Arches automatically creates data "
"entry forms based on your data models.\n"
"                                        Use Arches' Card Manager to "
"configure the look and feel of your data entry UI.\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                        Arches secara otomatis membuat "
"formulir entri data berdasarkan model data Anda.\n"
"                                        Gunakan Pengelola Kartu Arches "
"untuk mengatur tampilan UI entri data.\n"
"                                    "

#: app/templates/index.htm:297
msgid "Card Manager"
msgstr "Pengelola Kartu"

#: app/templates/index.htm:304
msgid "Data Security"
msgstr "Keamanan Data"

#: app/templates/index.htm:306
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Use Arches' Permissions Manager to "
"set up data access rules for all your\n"
"                                        user groups and individual "
"accounts. You can define read/write/delete and no-access\n"
"                                        permissions.\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                        Gunakan Pengelola Izin Arches "
"untuk mengatur aturan akses data bagi semua kelompok\n"
"                                        dan akun. Anda dapat menentukan "
"izin baca/tulis/hapus dan tanpa-akses.\n"
"                                    "

#: app/templates/index.htm:314
msgid "Permissions Manager"
msgstr "Pengelola Izin"

