#: app/templates/index.htm:336
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Design step-wise data management "
"interfaces that simplify complex editing\n"
"                                        tasks. Ensure that everyone enters "
"data completely and consistently\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                        Rancang antarmuka pengelolaan data "
"bertahap yang menyederhanakan tugas penyuntingan kompleks.\n"
"                                        Pastikan semua orang memasukkan "
