"                                    "

#: app/templates/index.htm:348
msgid "Arches Workflows"
msgstr "Alur Kerja Arches"

#: app/templates/index.htm:363
msgid "Arches Search Tools"
msgstr "Alat Pencarian Arches"

#: app/templates/index.htm:364
msgid "Find what you're looking for"
msgstr "Temukan yang Anda cari"

#: app/templates/index.htm:366
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                        Arches comes with powerful built-"
"in search tools. Quickly filter large\n"
"                                        databases with term, geospatial, "
"and time-based search components\n"
"                                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                        Arches dilengkapi alat pencarian "
"bawaan yang kuat. Filter basis data besar dengan cepat\n"
"                                        memakai komponen pencarian "
"istilah, spasial, dan berbasis waktu\n"
"                                    "

#: app/templates/index.htm:377
msgid "Arches Search"
msgstr "Pencarian Arches"

#: app/templates/index.htm:383
msgid "Search Options"
msgstr "Opsi Pencarian"

#: app/templates/index.htm:385
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                    Arches gives you many ways to find "
"precisely the information you need, even if\n"
"                                    your Arches application contains 10's "
"of millions of records. In addition to term,\n"
"                                    thesaurus, geospatial, and temporal "
"filters, Arches provides you with advanced filtering\n"
"                                    options that support boolean logic, "
"inverses, and many other filtering options.\n"
"                                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                    Arches memberi banyak cara menemukan "
"informasi yang tepat, bahkan jika\n"
"                                    aplikasi Arches berisi puluhan juta "
"rekaman. Selain filter istilah,\n"
"                                    tesaurus, spasial, dan temporal, "
"Arches menyediakan opsi filter lanjutan\n"
"                                    yang mendukung logika boolean, invers, "
"dan banyak opsi lain.\n"
"                                "

#: app/templates/index.htm:394
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                    Arches' search capabilities also "
"provide for sophisticated data\n"
"                                    visualizations, including interactive "
"displays of the connections between your data\n"
"                                    objects using a Force Directed Graph.\n"
"                                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                    Kemampuan pencarian Arches juga "
"menyediakan visualisasi data yang canggih,\n"
"                                    termasuk tampilan interaktif koneksi "
"antar objek data memakai Graf Gaya Force Directed.\n"
"                                "

#: app/templates/index.htm:402
msgid ""
"\n"
"                                    If you're a software developer, you "
"can build on Arches modular search\n"
"                                    services and create your own filters, "
"reports, and visualizations to best show off your\n"
"                                    particular dataset.\n"
"                                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                                    Jika Anda pengembang perangkat lunak, "
"Anda dapat membangun layanan pencarian modular Arches\n"
"                                    dan membuat filter, laporan, serta "
"visualisasi sendiri agar paling menonjolkan dataset Anda.\n"
"                                "

